{
  "id": 320000660,
  "name": "Voidwing Moth",
  "desc": "A unique, moth-like TD endemic to the Dimmr Plains, often seen in areas heavily contaminated by Voidmatter.",
  "desc_open": "This enemy has a <color=HighlightB>higher RES</color> to <color=Light>Spectro DMG</color>.\nWhen the Voidwing Moth recovers from Immobilization, it cycles between the Wings Spread, Wings Folded, and Curled Up states.\nWhile in the Wings Spread state, its Vibration Strength reduces faster.\nWhile in the Wings Folded State, it takes less Vibration Strength reduction, and 30% less total DMG.\nWhile in the Curled Up state, it takes 50% more total DMG.\n\nA unique TD endemic to the Dimmr Plains, often seen in areas heavily contaminated by Voidmatter. It assumes a moth-like form with wings that shed Voidmatter particles.\nMoving with instinct under the influence of Voidmatter, these creatures were once the vanguard of Aleph-1's incursion.\nThough naturally passive, it will stop at nothing to annihilate its target once aggravated.",
  "rarity": 2,
  "element": 5,
